cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PP in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PP: Person Parameter Estimation"
abstract: >-
  Estimation of person parameters (abilities) in item response theory for the
  1, 2, 3 and 4 parameter logistic model, the (generalized) partial credit model
  and mixed tests, with MLE, WLE, MAP, EAP and robust estimation, jackknife,
  plausible values and person fit statistics.
